{"seq":4,"slug":"livestock-production-management","title":"畜禽生产与管理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/animal-science/livestock-production-management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"swine-production","title":"大学动物科学 — 现代养猪生产体系","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/animal-science/livestock-production-management/swine-production","wordCount":1702,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"poultry-production","title":"大学动物科学 — 家禽生产与禽蛋体系","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/animal-science/livestock-production-management/poultry-production","wordCount":1763,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"ruminant-welfare-sustainability","title":"大学动物科学 — 反刍家畜生产、动物福利与可持续","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/animal-science/livestock-production-management/ruminant-welfare-sustainability","wordCount":1847,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"畜禽生产与管理\">畜禽生产与管理</h1><p>前三章打下的解剖、营养、遗传基础，最终都要落到一座真实农场的日常运营里。本章把视角拉回生产一线，分别走进现代化的养猪、家禽和牛羊生产体系，看看一头猪从出生到出栏、一只蛋鸡一年下多少蛋、一群奶牛如何被科学管理，并讨论环境控制、生物安全与动物福利这些贯穿始终的关键议题。</p>\n<p>这是把知识变成产出的章节。你将看到工程、管理与生物学如何交织成一套精密的生产系统，也将理解现代畜牧业为何越来越像一座&quot;用动物作为生产单元&quot;的智能工厂。</p>\n"}